{"format":"helia-content","version":1,"id":"universal-property","title":{"Inline":[{"Text":"What is a universal property, really?"}]},"title_text":"What is a universal property, really?","kind":"note","taxon":null,"url":"universal-property.html","content":{"Block":[{"Group":{"role":"entry","attrs":[["entry","universal-property"],["kind","note"]],"body":{"Block":[{"Paragraph":[{"Text":"Universal properties are a convenient method for defining an object in a category up to isomorphism. Rather than giving a concrete, bottom-up construction of an object, we can instead uniquely specify its behavior."}]},{"Paragraph":[{"Text":"Consider the example of products in a category "},{"Math":{"src":"C"}},{"Text":". We say that "},{"Emph":[{"Text":"the product"}]},{"Text":" of "},{"Math":{"src":"c"}},{"Text":" and "},{"Math":{"src":"d"}},{"Text":" is any object "},{"Math":{"src":"p"}},{"Text":" of "},{"Math":{"src":"C"}},{"Text":" such that the following diagram commutes."}]},{"Group":{"role":"ext-svg","attrs":[["svg","<svg class=\"helia-typst-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 145.797230941 146.42007874\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14.58em\" height=\"14.642em\" role=\"img\"><g><g><path fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0.48\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"miter\" stroke-miterlimit=\"4\" transform=\"translate(9.986352477 80.459830521)\" d=\"M 0 0m 55.966184938 0l -55.966184938 55.766825739\"></path><path fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0.48\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"miter\" stroke-miterlimit=\"4\" transform=\"translate(9.651937223 133.220538637)\" d=\"M 0 0m 0.334415328 3.006117521c 0.371345199 -0.998397957 0.247269133 -2.11373928 -0.334415328 -3.006117521\"></path><path fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0.48\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"miter\" stroke-miterlimit=\"4\" transform=\"translate(9.986352551 136.020023343)\" d=\"M 0 0m 0 0.206632815c 0.999716803 -0.367779895 2.